SCENARIO B:
Lok Sabha demo participation completed.

Expected:
Lok Sabha = VOTED.
Assembly = PENDING.

SCENARIO C:
Assembly demo participation completed.

Expected:
Assembly = VOTED.
Lok Sabha = PENDING.

SCENARIO D:
Both completed.

Expected:
